  ('back_end','mrrCollectionRate','Collection %','rate','up',0.65,'October 48.8% ($7,321 of $14,999), September 28.4%. October''s plan asked 80%; this is a step toward it.',1036),
  ('back_end','upsellCash','Upsells cash','usd','up',3500,'The SEO/GEO add-on in Ocean Home''s proposal: $13,500 against $10,000 for the six months alone. It has not been sent.',1039),
  ('money','totalCash','Total new cash','usd','up',43300,'The goal: the $43,300 October''s own plan set and did not reach ($24,486 on the rails by 29 Oct). Type a new number here and the funnel works back from it.',1045),
